{"headword":"שָׂכַל","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb.</strong> be prudent <strong>(</strong>Gerber<sup>47</sup> denom. from <span dir=\"rtl\">שֶׂכֶל</span>, but vb. early; NH <span dir=\"rtl\">סָכַל</span>, Hithp. <em>shew oneself attentive</em> (to), <em>look;</em> Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">סְכַל</span> (rare) <em>understand</em>, Ithpa. <em>look</em> (at), <em>consider</em>, Aph. <em>instruct;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂכַל</span> only Aph. (for Heb. <span dir=\"rtl\">הִשְׂכִּיל</span>), <em>understand, make wise;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">ܣܟܰܠ</span> Pa. <em>teach</em>, Ethpa. <em>understand</em>, etc.; Sam. <span dir=\"rtl\">ࠎࠊࠋ</span> Ithpa. <em>look</em> (for Heb. <span dir=\"rtl\">הִבִּיט</span>); Assyrian <em>šiklu</em>, <em>clever</em>, <em>šiklûtu</em>, <em>cleverness</em>, Meissn<sup>Suppl. 93</sup><strong>)</strong>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 18:30\" href=\"/I_Samuel.18.30\">1 S 18:30</a> <em>be prudent, circumspect</em> (SS HPS); Kit Buhl Gerber al. <em>prosper</em>."}],"form":"Qal"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">הִשְׂכִּיל</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 23:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.23.5\">Je 23:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 28:19\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.28.19\">1 Ch 28:19</a>; 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">הִשְׂכַּלְתִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:99\" href=\"/Psalms.119.99\">ψ 119:99</a>; 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">הִשְׂכִּילוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 34:27\" href=\"/Job.34.27\">Jb 34:27</a> +; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יַשְׂכִּיל</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 18:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.18.5\">1 S 18:5</a> +; 2 ms. juss. <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּשְׂכֵּל</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 9:25\" href=\"/Daniel.9.25\">Dn 9:25</a>, etc.; Imv. mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַשְׂכִּילוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 2:10\" href=\"/Psalms.2.10\">ψ 2:10</a>; Inf. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַשְׂכֵּל</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 9:23\" href=\"/Jeremiah.9.23\">Je 9:23</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">הַשְׂכֵּיל</span> (Ges<sup>§ 53 k</sup>) <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:15\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.15\">Je 3:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 34:35\" href=\"/Job.34.35\">Jb 34:35</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַשְׂכִּיל</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 3:6\" href=\"/Genesis.3.6\">Gn 3:6</a> +, etc.; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַשְׂכִּיל</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 18:14\" href=\"/I_Samuel.18.14\">1 S 18:14</a> +, f. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַשְׂכָּ֑לֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:14\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.14\">Pr 19:14</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַשְׂכִּילִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:35\" href=\"/Daniel.11.35\">Dn 11:35</a> +, etc.; meanings hard to classify: scholars differ greatly;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>look at:</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">נֶחְמָד הָעֵץ לְהַשְׂכִּיל</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 3:6\" href=\"/Genesis.3.6\">Gn 3:6</a> (J) <em>was desirable to look upon</em> (so 𝔊 Ges De; AV, RV <em>to make one wise;</em> Ew Di Buhl SS Dr al. sub <strong>3</strong>)."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>give attention to, consider, ponder:</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 41:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.41.20\">Is 41:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 44:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.44.18\">44:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:29\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.29\">Dt 32:29</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 64:10\" href=\"/Psalms.64.10\">ψ 64:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 106:7\" href=\"/Psalms.106.7\">106:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 34:27\" href=\"/Job.34.27\">Jb 34:27</a>; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 21:12\" href=\"/Proverbs.21.12\">Pr 21:12</a>; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶל</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 41:2\" href=\"/Psalms.41.2\">ψ 41:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 8:13\" href=\"/Nehemiah.8.13\">Ne 8:13</a>; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:20\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.20\">Pr 16:20</a>; c. ב <a data-ref=\"Psalms 101:2\" href=\"/Psalms.101.2\">ψ 101:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 9:13\" href=\"/Daniel.9.13\">Dn 9:13</a>."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>have insight, comprehension:</em> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 9:23\" href=\"/Jeremiah.9.23\">Je 9:23</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יָדַע י׳</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 94:8\" href=\"/Psalms.94.8\">ψ 94:8</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּין</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:99\" href=\"/Psalms.119.99\">119:99</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 1:4\" href=\"/Daniel.1.4\">Dn 1:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 9:25\" href=\"/Daniel.9.25\">9:25</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יָדַע</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">הַשְׂכֵּ(י)ל</span> as subst. = <em>insight, understanding:</em> as <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>’s gift to ruler and teacher, ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">דֵּעָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:15\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.15\">Je 3:15</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּ֫עַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 34:35\" href=\"/Job.34.35\">Jb 34:35</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מַדָּע</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 1:17\" href=\"/Daniel.1.17\">Dn 1:17</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מוּסַר הַשׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 1:3\" href=\"/Proverbs.1.3\">Pr 1:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">דֶּרֶךְ הַשׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 21:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.21.16\">21:16</a>."}],"num":"3."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>cause to consider, give insight, teach:</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> subj., acc. rei, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 28:19\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.28.19\">1 Ch 28:19</a>, acc. pers. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 32:8\" href=\"/Psalms.32.8\">ψ 32:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:20\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.20\">Ne 9:20</a>; Gabriel subj., 2 acc. <a data-ref=\"Daniel 9:22\" href=\"/Daniel.9.22\">Dn 9:22</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">לֵב חָכָם</span> subj., acc. rei <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:23\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.23\">Pr 16:23</a>; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 21:11\" href=\"/Proverbs.21.11\">Pr 21:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הַמַּשְׂכִּילִים שֵׂכֶל טוֹב לי׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 30:22\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.30.22\">2 Ch 30:22</a> (but Be Ke Benz etc. <em>who shewed</em> good <em>skill</em>, sc. in music, v <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 30:21\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.30.21\">21b</a>); <span dir=\"rtl\">(הַ)מַשְׂכִּילִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:33\" href=\"/Daniel.11.33\">Dn 11:33</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:35\" href=\"/Daniel.11.35\">35</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 12:3\" href=\"/Daniel.12.3\">12:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 12:10\" href=\"/Daniel.12.10\">10</a> <em>the teachers</em> (so Ew Hi Bev; Thes Ke Behrm al. <em>the wise</em>)."}],"num":"4."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>act circumspectly, prudently:</em> abs. <a data-ref=\"Amos 5:13\" href=\"/Amos.5.13\">Am 5:13</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 2:10\" href=\"/Psalms.2.10\">ψ 2:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 36:4\" href=\"/Psalms.36.4\">36:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַשְׂכִּיל</span> as subst. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 14:2\" href=\"/Psalms.14.2\">ψ 14:2</a> = <a data-ref=\"Psalms 53:3\" href=\"/Psalms.53.3\">53:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 10:5\" href=\"/Proverbs.10.5\">Pr 10:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 10:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.10.19\">19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:35\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.35\">14:35</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:24\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.24\">15:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 17:2\" href=\"/Proverbs.17.2\">17:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 22:2\" href=\"/Job.22.2\">Jb 22:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אִשָּׁה מַשְׂכָּ֑לֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:14\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.14\">Pr 19:14</a>.—<a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:9\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.9\">Je 50:9</a> has <span dir=\"rtl\">גִּבּוֹר מַשְׁכִּיל</span> according to Mas. (van d. H. Baer Gi), cf. 𝔙, i.e. a child-slaying warrior; but <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳</span> Hiph. elsewhere only <a data-ref=\"Hosea 9:14\" href=\"/Hosea.9.14\">Ho 9:14</a>, of miscarriage; 𝔊 𝔖 Ew and most mod. (Gf Gie Rothst) read <span dir=\"rtl\">מַשְׂכִּיל</span>, either <em>skilful</em> or <em>fortunate</em>."}],"num":"5."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>prosper, have success</em> (cf. Dr <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 18:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.18.5\">1 S 18:5</a>): abs. <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 18:15\" href=\"/I_Samuel.18.15\">1 S 18:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 52:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.52.13\">Is 52:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 10:21\" href=\"/Jeremiah.10.21\">Je 10:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 20:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.20.11\">20:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 23:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.23.5\">23:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 1:8\" href=\"/Joshua.1.8\">Jos 1:8</a> (D); c. ב, v <a data-ref=\"Joshua 1:7\" href=\"/Joshua.1.7\">7</a> (D) <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 18:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.18.5\">1 S 18:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 18:14\" href=\"/I_Samuel.18.14\">14</a> (read <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּכָל־</span> for <span dir=\"rtl\">לְכָל־</span> Vrss Th HPS al.), cf. <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:7\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.7\">2 K 18:7</a>; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶל</span>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 17:8\" href=\"/Proverbs.17.8\">Pr 17:8</a>."}],"num":"6."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>cause to prosper:</em> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 29:8\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.29.8\">Dt 29:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 2:3\" href=\"/I_Kings.2.3\">1 K 2:3</a> (D)."}],"num":"7."}],"form":"Hiph."}]},"rid":"BDB09702","strong_numbers":["7919"],"next_hw":"שֵׂ֫כֶל","prev_hw":"שֻׂכָּה","all_cited":true,"ordinal":"I.","root":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["8505","8506"],"TWOT":["2263","2264"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}